  "Scenes.Jeanclaudescenes.BeatDaFuckhugeBasilisk.SnarlsRichVoiceAgain": "[pg][say: Épargne-moi ta miséricorde, intrus,] he snarls, his rich voice heavy with exertion and humiliation. [say: Spare me of your forgiveness and spare me of your mercy kill. I will see my own way out. Trust me- once the bitch queen has got her hands on you, you will wish you did the same thing.] He reaches for his throat with his sharp claws. You are grateful that he no longer has the power to hold your gaze- unfortunately there is no way of closing your ears. You turn away as, with a wet choke and gurgle, a small part of the evil holding this place departs forever."
