  "Scenes.Jeanclaudescenes.BwombBadEnd.RexGlow": "The Rex's yellow glow encompasses you, glaring out everything- your purpose, your memories, your sense of self, replaced only by the need to stare deeper and deeper into the pits of gold, the depthless lava of his will which rolls over you, heats you within and without. When he steps into you and puts his warm, smooth hand on your waist you almost flinch, you are that sensitive to his presence. He grins with the exhilaration of a conqueror as he draws you further into himself. The nagging undercurrents of your own body rise to the surface as you feel his warmth and smell his powerful musk; your [vagina] beads with excitement and the bubble which sits in front of your stomach seems to expand, flooding your system with pheromones which make your heart pump faster and your skin turn red as your body reacts to the presence of this alpha male. Jean-Claude breathes your own smell deeply, his smile widening as he stares into your unfocused, helpless eyes."
